lucina-fontsan  (MPL-2.0 AND BSD-3-Clause)
  Derived by behaviour from OTS, the OpenType Sanitizer (Chromium, https://github.com/khaledhosny/ots, as shipped
  in the fontsan crate 0.7.0): its accept/reject decisions, table whitelist, limits and error strings are
  reproduced. OTS is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause licence, see LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause-OTS.txt
  (Copyright (c) 2009-2017 The OTS Authors. All rights reserved.).
  WOFF and WOFF2 decoding uses the wuff crate (https://github.com/nicoburns/wuff), licensed under the MIT licence,
  which is a dependency and is not copied into this repository.

lucina-fontface  (MPL-2.0)
  Original code written to replace the FreeType-backed font code of Servo (Mozilla Public License 2.0). It
  uses lucina-ftcompat for its FreeType-compatible numbers and the read-fonts and skrifa crates for font parsing.

Third-party crates are used as dependencies under their own licences (see Cargo.lock; checked with cargo deny,
